# =================================================================
# XENA AI — University Orientation Assistant Environment Configuration
# =================================================================
#
# ZERO-CONFIGURATION DEFAULTS IN GOOGLE AI STUDIO:
# You DO NOT need to manually configure the 6 variables below in Google AI Studio.
# The application ships with sensible, production-ready defaults:
#
#   1. Model: Runs Google Gemma (gemma-4-26b-a4b-it) natively via @google/genai.
#   2. Voice Transcription: Uses native Gemini audio understanding via GEMINI_API_KEY.
#   3. Text-to-Speech: Uses browser Web Speech API (zero cloud keys or setup needed).
#   4. Translation: Uses native Gemini API with academic term preservation.
#   5. Cloud Project ID: NOT required (no Google Cloud IAM / service accounts needed).
#
# The ONLY variable utilized is GEMINI_API_KEY, which Google AI Studio provides
# automatically in the runtime environment.
# =================================================================

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Automatically provided by Google AI Studio.
# Required for Gemma model inference, audio transcription, and translation.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# (OPTIONAL OVERRIDES - All have built-in defaults if left blank):
# GEMMA_MODEL_ID="gemma-4-26b-a4b-it"   # Default: gemma-4-26b-a4b-it
# AI_PROVIDER="google-genai"             # Default: google-genai
# APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"        # Default: auto-detected
